    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870410/extras/2d1b14b42984284442eec7540f8740d7.webp?t=1736178889\" width=259 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been kidnapped and locked in a dark workshop where machines come to life and time flows non-linearly. In <strong>Henry's Forgotten Performance</strong>, you will unravel the terrible secrets of the long abandoned <strong>Freude Corporation</strong>. Use the power of time and decide the fate of the creator of this nightmare. But be careful, everything here has a price.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870410/extras/fa5d441ca69cf5b06363651dbc1bbe20.webp?t=1736178889\" width=259 height=54 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Clock Key</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Clock Key</strong> is a unique artifact that allows you to control time within the confines of a mysterious workshop. With it you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow down enemies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewind time</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duplicating objects</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to solve <strong>interesting puzzles</strong> related to <strong><i>time</i></strong>, such as how to find an object that disappeared 10 years ago, or how to get into a room that only existed in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870410/extras/513b5c558bcc84f2a231b1e5b3fa83c9.webp?t=1736178889\" width=376 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark workshop comes to life...</strong> Machines whisper about their creator, and living dolls are hunting you. How far are you willing to go to discover their secret?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870410/extras/2d1b14b42984284442eec7540f8740d7.webp?t=1736178889\" width=259 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been kidnapped and locked in a dark workshop where machines come to life and time flows non-linearly. In <strong>Henry's Forgotten Performance</strong>, you will unravel the terrible secrets of the long abandoned <strong>Freude Corporation</strong>. Use the power of time and decide the fate of the creator of this nightmare. But be careful, everything here has a price.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870410/extras/fa5d441ca69cf5b06363651dbc1bbe20.webp?t=1736178889\" width=259 height=54 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Clock Key</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Clock Key</strong> is a unique artifact that allows you to control time within the confines of a mysterious workshop. With it you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow down enemies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewind time</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duplicating objects</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to solve <strong>interesting puzzles</strong> related to <strong><i>time</i></strong>, such as how to find an object that disappeared 10 years ago, or how to get into a room that only existed in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870410/extras/513b5c558bcc84f2a231b1e5b3fa83c9.webp?t=1736178889\" width=376 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark workshop comes to life...</strong> Machines whisper about their creator, and living dolls are hunting you. How far are you willing to go to discover their secret?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Explore eerie locations, solve interesting puzzles, and uncover the dark secrets of a massive corporation. Manipulate time to your advantage, but beware - unstable forces lurk in the shadows, and they won\u2019t hesitate to make you their prey. Can you outsmart them and escape?",
